title: Dirty Chai Negroni
servings: 2
prep-time: 5 minutes
cook-time: 0 minutes
tags: [negroni, cocktails, cocktail-recipes, festive-cocktails]
source: https://www.instagram.com/reel/DSc0_7HjhWh/
image: https://scontent-iad3-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/603892067_883215344391702_1734651052792583388_n.jpg?stp=cmp1_dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=101&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0xJUFMuYmVzdF9pbWFnZV91cmxnZW4uQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=geLx0PO-YokQ7kNvwE58zon&_nc_oc=AdlmLgPCjnqf2AaDZVfcXr1PBCkNr36GDzHMQR1x4M1UOW6jPNtUpqM9F3DTrAESKj4&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=SV5qyl7YfsY3Q0EJLKYcSA&oh=00_AfnV28BrwQP48ZPPsRQKa6l2Ro3KD5Z9jn7sXSg9BOtGbw&oe=69562E46
---

In a #mixing glass{}, combine @gin{2%oz}, @campari{2%oz}, @sweet vermouth{2%oz}, @chai syrup{1%oz}, and @espresso{2%oz} with ice, then stir until well chilled for ~{20%seconds}.

Strain the mixture into two #rocks glass{} over fresh ice, then garnish with an orange twist.